    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>ScheduledJobsDisabled</name>
      <id>55</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>A scheduled job lock was applied during the update.
To release the lock, &lt;link Restart>restart the application&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>قفل کارهای زمان‌بندی‌شده در طول به‌روزرسانی اعمال شد.
برای آزادسازی قفل، &lt;link Restart>برنامه را مجدداً راه‌اندازی کنید&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>При выполнения обновления была установлена блокировка выполнения регламентных заданий.
Для разблокировки требуется &lt;link Restart>перезапустить приложение&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Güncelleme sırasında planlanmış işlerin yürütülmesi engellendi. 
Kilidi açmak için &lt;link Restart>programı yeniden başlatmanız&lt;/> gerekir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Khi thực hiện cập nhật đã đặt phong tỏa thực hiện nhiệm vụ thường kỳ.
Để bỏ phong tỏa, cần&lt;link Restart>khởi động lại ứng dụng&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>A scheduled job lock was applied during the update.
To release the lock, &lt;link Restart>restart the application&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>A scheduled job lock was applied during the update.
To release the lock, &lt;link Restart>restart the application&lt;/>.</value>
